  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "The example request below lists the test results for an Xcode Cloud build that performed a test action. Use the information provided in the response to display test results on a dashboard, create a new task for a failing test in your issue tracker, and so on.",
          "refs": []
        }
      ],
      "listItems": []
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Example Request and Response",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "**Request**\n\n```\nGET https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/ciBuildActions/d871dabb-2c2c-4012-aff5-abb427bcb3a3/testResults\n```\n\n**Response**\n\n```json\n{\n\"data\": [\n        {\n            \"type\": \"ciTestResults\",\n            \"id\": \"87f8a597-bea9-49d8-ba8b-6a643de66903\",\n            \"attributes\": {\n                \"className\": \"TestClass\",\n                \"name\": \"TestName\",\n                \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n                \"fileSource\": {\n                    \"path\": \"path\",\n                    \"lineNumber\": 100\n                },\n                \"message\": null,\n                \"destinationTestResults\": [\n                    {\n                        \"uuid\": \"8d1bff05-2b9c-4cc4-9225-e2cd41dee260\",\n                        \"deviceName\": \"iPhone X\",\n                        \"osVersion\": \"11.4.1\",\n                        \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n                        \"duration\": 6.600471973\n                    }\n                ]\n            },\n            \"links\": {\n                \"self\": \"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/ciTestResults/87f8a597-bea9-49d8-ba8b-6a643de66903\"\n            }\n        }\n    ],\n    \"links\": {\n        \"self\": \"https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/ciBuildActions/d871dabb-2c2c-4012-aff5-abb427bcb3a3/testResults\"\n    },\n    \"meta\": {\n        \"paging\": {\n            \"limit\": 50\n        }\n    }\n}\n```",
          "refs": []
        }
      ],
      "listItems": []
    }
